{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","翱翔天际的白银之翼"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Silver-White Wings that Streak Across the Skies"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","玛露西尔的所有技能均需要吟唱施法。主动使用时持续施法召唤天空鱼攻击敌人。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","All of Marcille's skills require chanting to cast. When actively used, she continuously summons Sky Fish to attack enemies."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，自身的各项技能均需要消耗时间吟唱施法，但玛露西尔会不间断地尝试释放各项技能，且其吟唱速度会受到急速和攻击速度的共同影响。每当玛露西尔成功地完成一次吟唱，便会永久提高自身10点急速与5%能量恢复速度，最多叠加10次。\n主动使用时，立即扣除200点魔法值，并且每秒持续消耗80法力值吟唱施法，召唤天空鱼在场上冲刺，每次攻击会对一条路径上的所有敌人造成500% + 50% ATK伤害。天空鱼冲刺的基础吟唱频率为每2秒一次。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Passive. All of Marcille's skills require chanting to cast. Her chanting speed is affected by both Haste and ATK SPD, and she continuously attempts to cast her various skills. Each time Marcille finishes chanting, she permanently increases her Haste by 10 and Energy Recovery Rate by 5%, stacking up to 10 times.\nActive. Marcille immediately spends 200 Energy and continues to chant at a cost of 80 Energy per second. Summons Sky Fish to dash across the battlefield and deal 500% + 50% ATK damage to enemies in its path. The base chanting frequency for summoning Sky Fish is once every 2s."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":181,"end":187,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":479,"end":485,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":177,"end":191,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":475,"end":489,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","天空鱼造成的伤害提升至520% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt by Sky Fish to 520% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","天空鱼造成的伤害提升至530% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt by Sky Fish to 530% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","天空鱼造成的伤害提升至540% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt by Sky Fish to 540% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","天空鱼造成的伤害提升至550% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt by Sky Fish to 550% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","爆炸魔法"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Explosive Spell"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","吟唱一段时间后，释放爆炸魔法对一片范围内的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","After chanting for a while, Marcille unleashes an Explosive Spell, dealing AoE damage."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","吟唱3秒后，在敌方最密集区域施放爆炸魔法，对半径1格范围内的所有敌人造成300% + 40% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","After chanting for 3s, Marcille unleashes an Explosive Spell in the area with the most enemies, dealing 300% + 40% ATK damage to all enemies within a 1-tile radius."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":108,"end":114,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":104,"end":118,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至330% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 330% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至370% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 370% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 400% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","闪光魔法"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Magical Flash"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","吟唱一段时间后，释放闪光魔法，对一名友军产生治疗，伤害并致盲其附近的敌人。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","After chanting for a while, Marcille unleashes a magical flash, healing an ally while damaging and blinding nearby enemies."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","吟唱2秒后，在一名身边有敌人的友军身边产生耀眼的光芒，为其恢复300% + 30% ATK生命值，并对周围所有敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害并使其致盲，持续4 + 0.4秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","After chanting for 2s, Marcille generates a magical flash of light around an ally surrounded by enemies, recovering 300% + 30% ATK of the ally's HP, while dealing 240% + 30% ATK damage to all nearby enemies and blinding them for 4 + 0.4s."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":63,"end":69,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":84,"end":90,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":120,"end":126,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":167,"end":173,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":230,"end":236,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":59,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":116,"end":130,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":163,"end":177,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 260% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 280% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 300% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提升急速。终极技能吟唱期间额外提升急速。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Marcille increases her Haste during battle. While chanting to cast her Ultimate, she increases her Haste by an additional amount."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，玛露西尔提升10点急速。在终极技能吟唱期间，额外提升6点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Marcille increases her Haste by 10 during battle. While chanting to cast her Ultimate, she increases Haste by an additional 6."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，玛露西尔提升14点急速。在终极技能吟唱期间，额外提升7点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Marcille increases her Haste by 14 during battle. While chanting to cast her Ultimate, she increases Haste by an additional 7."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，玛露西尔提升18点急速。在终极技能吟唱期间，额外提升8点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Marcille increases her Haste by 18 during battle. While chanting to cast her Ultimate, she increases Haste by an additional 8."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","禁忌的古代魔法"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Ancient Magic"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","吟唱一段时间后，施法古代魔法，复活一名友方英雄。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","After chanting for a while, Marcille casts ancient magic to revive a fallen allied hero."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在脚下生成古代魔法阵。吟唱3秒后，复活一名友方英雄，并使其恢复400% ATK生命值，每场战斗最多只能成功释放1次。布阵时，若自己身前1格处有友军，则本技能只会选择该友军为目标。若己方上阵了莱欧斯，则本技能可以额外复活一次莱欧斯（无需满足站位条件、且不消耗本技能的使用次数），但每场战斗最多只能触发1次。若本技能在吟唱过程中被打断，则后续5秒内无法再次释放。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Marcille generates an ancient magic circle at her feet. After chanting for 3s, Marcille revives an allied hero and recovers 400% ATK HP for them. This skill can only be cast once per battle. During battle preparation, if there is an ally placed 1 tile in front of Marcille, this skill will target that ally. However, if Laios is on the team, this skill can revive him one additional time (no position requirement and does not consume the skill's use limit), but this can only trigger once per battle. If the chanting is interrupted, this skill cannot be recast for 5s."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":124,"end":132,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","被复活的友方英雄生命值恢复提高至450% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Revived allies recover 450% ATK HP."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","本技能吟唱期间，古代魔法阵每秒会对场上所有敌人造成250% ATK伤害，并吸收伤害量的100%，将这部分数值增加至复活目标的生命恢复量当中。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","While chanting to cast this skill, the ancient magic circle deals 250% ATK damage each second to all enemies and converts 100% of the damage dealt into additional HP for the revived ally."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":66,"end":74,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","被复活的友方英雄生命值恢复提高至500% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Revived allies recover 500% ATK HP."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","玛露西尔拥有来自其他友军的属性提升效果时，每秒可额外恢复能量。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Marcille recovers additional Energy while buffed by allies."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，玛露西尔当前每拥有一个来自不同友军的属性提升效果，每秒便会额外恢复10点能量，该效果最多同时叠加3层。当拥有3层该效果时，玛露西尔获得霸体。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","During battle, Marcille recovers 10 additional Energy per second for each ally who is currently providing her with a buff, up to 3 stacks. At 3 stacks, she becomes unaffected."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":71,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":164,"end":174,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","安布罗希亚"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Ambrosia"]]}